    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An exit strategy is necessary to:",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Identify possible risks;",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Define potential losses;",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Ensure service continuity.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "It should be a ‘front end’ activity created before the contract is signed. This may appear counterintuitive. However without a well thought out strategy (which is consistent with your overall sourcing strategy) your Organisation risks:",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Becoming stuck in an unsatisfactory contract relationship;",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Being forced to pay more to terminate the contract and minimise operational impact.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Having an exit strategy in place at the start of a supplier relationship means not only that your Organisation’s needs will be included into the contract, but that the supplier will have a clear road map through to contract close (this is particularly supportive for smaller business who may rely heavily on public sector contracts). The exit strategy should also include what would happen in the case of early termination and so help to ensure there will be minimum business and customer disruption if the relationship were terminated.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please note: you cannot terminate a contract with the aim of avoiding procurement rule obligations.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Exit strategies should be reviewed annually, or when significant change occurs",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There are several considerations to be made when developing an exit strategy, including:",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Continuing Service Requirements;",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Data Security and Privacy;",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Knowledge and Documentation Transfer;",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Costs;",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Personnel.",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Below suggests some factors for consideration. This is not an exhaustive list. Each contract / supplier relationship should be considered on its own merits.",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An exit strategy should set forth your organisation’s service requirements when the parties are transitioning out of the relationship. These requirements may include:",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "An obligation on the supplier to continue service performance during the transition period. During transition these services must stay at the same quality level and continue to comply with all contract obligations;",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An obligation on the supplier to continue service performance during the transition period. During transition these services must stay at the same quality level and continue to comply with all contract obligations;",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The provision of parallel services for a certain period. This can be necessary for continuity of supply and helps to resolve issues before the final change over;",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The provision of parallel services for a certain period. This can be necessary for continuity of supply and helps to resolve issues before the final change over;",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "An obligation by the supplier to keep the same supplier team performing services during the transition period;",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An obligation by the supplier to keep the same supplier team performing services during the transition period;",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00026",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Confidentiality on any communications regarding the termination of the relationship.",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00027",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Confidentiality on any communications regarding the termination of the relationship.",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00028",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "2. Data Security and Privacy",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00029",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Data privacy and security are critical. The Exit Strategy should consider provision for:",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00030",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The transfer of all data belonging to your organisation, including any customer information;",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00031",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The transfer of all data belonging to your organisation, including any customer information;",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00032",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "An acceptable method for the supplier to destroy and remove your organisation’s proprietary information;",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00033",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "An acceptable method for the supplier to destroy and remove your organisation’s proprietary information;",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00034",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The supplier destroying and removing sensitive information from all media. The supplier must ensure no information is disclosed to other individuals or organisations;",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00035",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The supplier destroying and removing sensitive information from all media. The supplier must ensure no information is disclosed to other individuals or organisations;",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00036",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "The return or transfer of each party’s assets.",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00037",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The return or transfer of each party’s assets.",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00038",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00039",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Strict documentation and knowledge transfer contract requirements will be advantageous. Be sure to:",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00040",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Require the supplier to give you access to everything your organisation will need to maintain the service;",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00041",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Require the supplier to give you access to everything your organisation will need to maintain the service;",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00042",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Clearly state responsibilities i.e. which party owns the work performed by the supplier and which party is responsible for the transfer of ownership;",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00043",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Clearly state responsibilities i.e. which party owns the work performed by the supplier and which party is responsible for the transfer of ownership;",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "heading_path": [
        "1. Continuing Service Requirements",
        "2. Data Security and Privacy",
        "3. Knowledge and Documentation Transfer"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00044",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Fully document the service description for any transition period additional services. These are services required from the supplier (e.g. employee training, training new supplier personnel);",
      "ordinal": 44,
